    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What the fish??</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gawr Gura: Quest for Bread is an action-platformer fan game where you jump, spin, and fight through unknown lands to help Gura reunite with her lost bread!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/760e77f66b271174f1c01df3dc16b4a6.poster.avif?t=1744396584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/760e77f66b271174f1c01df3dc16b4a6.webm?t=1744396584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/760e77f66b271174f1c01df3dc16b4a6.mp4?t=1744396584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roughly 3 hours of content</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tight, acrobatic platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple but satisfying combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique and challenging boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cameos from all five members of HoloMyth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/e6ba9c0632f5550609d2525fdf6fac6e.poster.avif?t=1744396584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/e6ba9c0632f5550609d2525fdf6fac6e.webm?t=1744396584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/e6ba9c0632f5550609d2525fdf6fac6e.mp4?t=1744396584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/bb14bd1382e84b4887c8881e06ba5d7f.poster.avif?t=1744396584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/bb14bd1382e84b4887c8881e06ba5d7f.webm?t=1744396584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/bb14bd1382e84b4887c8881e06ba5d7f.mp4?t=1744396584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This isn't a beach, this is a bathtub!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are plenty of inside jokes and callbacks to past Hololive streams, but no knowledge of the streamers is needed to enjoy the game! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What the fish??</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gawr Gura: Quest for Bread is an action-platformer fan game where you jump, spin, and fight through unknown lands to help Gura reunite with her lost bread!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/760e77f66b271174f1c01df3dc16b4a6.poster.avif?t=1744396584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/760e77f66b271174f1c01df3dc16b4a6.webm?t=1744396584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/760e77f66b271174f1c01df3dc16b4a6.mp4?t=1744396584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roughly 3 hours of content</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tight, acrobatic platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple but satisfying combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique and challenging boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cameos from all five members of HoloMyth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/e6ba9c0632f5550609d2525fdf6fac6e.poster.avif?t=1744396584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/e6ba9c0632f5550609d2525fdf6fac6e.webm?t=1744396584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/e6ba9c0632f5550609d2525fdf6fac6e.mp4?t=1744396584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/bb14bd1382e84b4887c8881e06ba5d7f.poster.avif?t=1744396584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/bb14bd1382e84b4887c8881e06ba5d7f.webm?t=1744396584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/bb14bd1382e84b4887c8881e06ba5d7f.mp4?t=1744396584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This isn't a beach, this is a bathtub!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are plenty of inside jokes and callbacks to past Hololive streams, but no knowledge of the streamers is needed to enjoy the game! </p>",
